{"4469230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Matter of Pain", "steam_appid": 4469230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Better to reign in Hell, than serve in Heaven.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>A Matter of Pain</strong>, you oversee a vast institutional complex dedicated to the administration of the damned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls arrive bearing guilt. <strong>Damnation is an industry like any other. It requires middle management.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duty is simple: <strong>process souls efficiently and keep the system running.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/1c75243b835ca05e91698a38a1ec5645.avif?t=1778117004\" width=780 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/e3b985fbc33a20b7ab206abc591a19cb.poster.avif?t=1778117004\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/e3b985fbc33a20b7ab206abc591a19cb.webm?t=1778117004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/e3b985fbc33a20b7ab206abc591a19cb.mp4?t=1778117004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design and expand your domain.</strong> Construct torture chambers, research offices, dormitories, vanity halls, infernal workshops, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/1cd8fcc67df8b24d26f119d4bdeaf6b1.avif?t=1778117004\" width=780 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/dfeb1a883fa9788c5dc8b48ee564d7be.poster.avif?t=1778117004\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/dfeb1a883fa9788c5dc8b48ee564d7be.webm?t=1778117004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/dfeb1a883fa9788c5dc8b48ee564d7be.mp4?t=1778117004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each soul arrives with distinct sins, temperaments, and thresholds of endurance. Some collapse under pressure. Others resist correction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classify them. Route them. Assign them to appropriate torture cycles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract <strong>Dolor</strong>, the refined currency of torment, and use it to expand your institutional capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/305294156ba9e725a0ba4d57cfd7c670.avif?t=1778117004\" width=780 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/0fe857d2d3f95d8fb68a75e5789b39c5.poster.avif?t=1778117004\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/0fe857d2d3f95d8fb68a75e5789b39c5.webm?t=1778117004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/0fe857d2d3f95d8fb68a75e5789b39c5.mp4?t=1778117004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your workforce consists of demonic administrators, engineers, and scholars of pain. Assign them carefully and maintain strict operational discipline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poor planning invites systemic failure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/ecbef9331ebc2c787f52185420adf1df.avif?t=1778117004\" width=780 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/b52483e4cfee1af0278a668dee030b2d.poster.avif?t=1778117004\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/b52483e4cfee1af0278a668dee030b2d.webm?t=1778117004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/b52483e4cfee1af0278a668dee030b2d.mp4?t=1778117004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop new devices. Unlock new processing methods. Refine architectural layouts. Expand your authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the institution grows, so do its demands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/78627643d484eb8615555549d9a8ac45.avif?t=1778117004\" width=780 height=74 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct</strong> and expand a modular infernal domain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Process</strong> souls shaped by distinct sins and personal histories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assign</strong> specialized demons to maximize efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> new devices and methods through doctrinal research</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance</strong> extraction, resistance, and institutional stability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presented in a measured, literary tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defined by a minimalist, oppressive aesthetic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Abandon hope, all ye who enter here.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Better to reign in Hell, than serve in Heaven.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>A Matter of Pain</strong>, you oversee a vast institutional complex dedicated to the administration of the damned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls arrive bearing guilt. <strong>Damnation is an industry like any other. It requires middle management.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duty is simple: <strong>process souls efficiently and keep the system running.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/1c75243b835ca05e91698a38a1ec5645.avif?t=1778117004\" width=780 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/e3b985fbc33a20b7ab206abc591a19cb.poster.avif?t=1778117004\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469230/extras/e3b985fbc33a20b7ab206abc591a19cb.webm?t=1778117004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source s